  "modifications": [
    "DMF local imports and scoped native normalization/utilities",
    "Upstream base-vega tokens replace former portfolio mapping",
    "Site dark-mode selector bridge; Yellow falls back to upstream light",
    "Explicit component-root dialog discovery and host-owned toast controllers",
    "Dialog viewport bounds and notification stacking",
    "Coarse-pointer 44px targets and reduced motion safeguards",
    "Tabs discovers explicit component roots with idempotent initialization and Astro teardown; upstream SSR initial-panel selection retained",
    "Tabs horizontal RTL arrow adapter preserves computed direction, manual activation, disabled skipping and nested-root boundaries",
    "Radio Group and Switch explicit component-root lifecycle with ready events for host forms",
    "Field description uses logical text-start; switch track direction isolated for RTL",
    "Native demo form validation, FormData preview, reset and disabled-until-ready host behavior",
    "Coarse-pointer label targets preserve checkbox/radio/switch artwork geometry",
    "Switch clears native button padding and uses matched pixel geometry with equal 2px thumb endpoint insets for default/small sizes across root font sizes",
    "Select uses explicit idempotent DMF roots, preset-aware portal scopes, logical spacing/alignment and form readiness events",
    "Popover and Dropdown Menu use explicit idempotent roots, preset-aware scoped portals and teardown; logical menu spacing, viewport bounds and coarse-pointer targets; link activation listener is portal-scoped"
